      "writtenOn": "2021-09-08T15:35:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not that I disagree with your idea, but I thought it was worth mentioning--we use Runtime Effects in several places internally now, so the internal/external line isn\u0027t as clear-cut as that.",
      "parentUuid": "7422a377_7830dfd1",
      "revId": "1387102ca3da18d03677388b69c0b70eb6dac517",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
